troke-linecap="round" marker-start="url(#marker2)"/><text transform="translate(177.3984603881836 430.84000000000003)" text-anchor="top" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text"> Qu&eacute;bec City</text><line x1="113.3984603881836" y1="455.84000000000003" x2="140.3984603881836" y2="455.84000000000003" stroke="#999" stroke-width="3.5" marker-end="url(#marker3)"/><line x1="140.3984603881836" y1="455.84000000000003" x2="167.3984603881836" y2="455.84000000000003" stroke="#999" stroke-width="3.5" marker-start="url(#marker3)"/><text transform="translate(177.3984603881836 462.84000000000003)" text-anchor="top" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text"> Toronto</text><line x1="124.16718816757202" y1="252" x2="192.97656297683716" y2="248" stroke="#000" stroke-width="2.4" marker-end="url(#marker0)" marker-start="url(#marker0)"/><line x1="124.16718816757202" y1="200.66666666666666" x2="192.97656297683716" y2="178" stroke="#000" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-dasharray="9 6" marker-end="url(#marker1)" marker-start="url(#marker1)"/><line x1="124.16718816757202" y1="232" x2="192.97656297683716" y2="230.66666666666666" stroke="#000" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="1.1 6" stroke-linecap="round" marker-end="url(#marker2)" marker-start="url(#marker2)"/><line x1="124.16718816757202" y1="234.66666666666666" x2="192.97656297683716" y2="214.66666666666666" stroke="#999" stroke-width="3.5" marker-end="url(#marker3)" marker-start="url(#marker3)"/><line x1="192.97656297683716" y1="248" x2="261.7859377861023" y2="246" stroke="#000" stroke-width="2.4" marker-end="url(#marker0)" marker-start="url(#marker0)"/><line x1="192.97656297683716" y1="178" x2="261.7859377861023" y2="127.33333333333331" stroke="#000" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-dasharray="9 6" marker-end="url(#marker1)" marker-start="url(#marker1)"/><line x1="192.97656297683716" y1="230.66666666666666" x2="261.7859377861023" y2="230" stroke="#000" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="1.1 6" stroke-linecap="round" marker-end="url(#marker2)" marker-start="url(#marker2)"/><line x1="192.97656297683716" y1="214.66666666666666" x2="261.7859377861023" y2="151.33333333333331" stroke="#999" stroke-width="3.5" marker-end="url(#marker3)" marker-start="url(#marker3)"/><line x1="261.7859377861023" y1="246" x2="330.59531259536743" y2="244.66666666666666" stroke="#000" stroke-width="2.4" marker-end="url(#marker0)" marker-start="url(#marker0)"/><line x1="261.7859377861023" y1="127.33333333333331" x2="330.59531259536743" y2="93.33333333333334" stroke="#000" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-dasharray="9 6" marker-end="url(#marker1)" marker-start="url(#marker1)"/><line x1="261.7859377861023" y1="230" x2="330.59531259536743" y2="226" stroke="#000" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="1.1 6" stroke-linecap="round" marker-end="url(#marker2)" marker-start="url(#marker2)"/><line x1="261.7859377861023" y1="151.33333333333331" x2="330.59531259536743" y2="133.33333333333331" stroke="#999" stroke-width="3.5" marker-end="url(#marker3)" marker-start="url(#marker3)"/></g></svg></figure><div class="sr-only" role="region" aria-label="Long description for line graph titled Census Data for Four Canadian Cities, 1871–1901"><ul>
<li>The following 4 lines are shown:<br/>
<ul>
<li>Halifax</li>
<li>Montr&eacute;al</li>
<li>Qu&eacute;bec City</li>
<li>Toronto</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>The Halifax line:<br/>
<ul>
<li>Begins at 1871, 30 thousand</li>
<li>Rises gradually to 1881, 36 thousand&nbsp;</li>
<li>Rises gradually to 1891, 39 thousand</li>
<li>Rises gradually to 1901, 41 thousand</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>The Montr&eacute;al line:<br/>
<ul>
<li>Begins at 1871, 107 thousand</li>
<li>Rises gradually to 1881, 141 thousand&nbsp;</li>
<li>Rises sharply to 1891, 217 thousand</li>
<li>Rises sharply to 1901, 268 thousand</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>The Qu&eacute;bec City line:<br/>
<ul>
<li>Begins at 1871, 60 thousand</li>
<li>Rises gradually to 1881, 62 thousand&nbsp;</li>
<li>Rises gradually to 1891, 63 thousand</li>
<li>Rises gradually to 1901, 69 thousand</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>The Toronto line:<br/>
<ul>
<li>Begins at 1871, 56 thousand</li>
<li>Rises gradually to 1881, 86 thousand&nbsp;</li>
<li>Rises sharply to 1891, 181 thousand</li>
<li>Rises gradually to 1901, 208 thousand</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul></div>
<p>The first national census in Canada was conducted in <span data-ssml-say-as="date">1871</span>. The graph shows the population sizes of some of the largest Canadian cities from each of the first four national censuses, which occurred every ten years.</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$<p>According to the graph, which city had the largest population in <span data-ssml-say-as="date">1891</span>?</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$[{"id":"09cf7f70-9cab-45c7-b942-fda828417176","content":"<p>Toronto</p>"},{"id":"9e994dd2-f3cd-4417-a747-5e6c1b73cd59","content":"<p>Montr&eacute;al</p>"},{"id":"5b9de4f6-5998-420e-bd1d-03a99a23977c","content":"<p>Qu&eacute;bec City</p>"},{"id":"231e5659-93ab-4ee8-81e4-603c91235aa9","content":"<p>Halifax</p>"}]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["B"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["9e994dd2-f3cd-4417-a747-5e6c1b73cd59"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p>Choice B is the best answer because the graph shows that Montr&eacute;al had the largest population in 1891 among the four cities represented. According to the data points in the graph for the year 1891, Montr&eacute;al&rsquo;s population was approximately 220,000, which is greater than the respective populations of Toronto (approximately 180,000), Qu&eacute;bec City (approximately 60,000), and Halifax (approximately 40,000).</p><p>Choice A is incorrect because Toronto&rsquo;s population in 1891 was approximately 180,000, which is the second largest among the four cities shown but still clearly smaller than Montr&eacute;al&rsquo;s population of approximately 220,000. Choice C is incorrect because Qu&eacute;bec City had a population of approximately 60,000 in 1891, making it only the third largest of the four cities shown. Choice D is incorrect because Halifax had a population of approximately 40,000 people in 1891. Of the four cities shown in the graph, Halifax has the smallest population, not the largest.</p>$SATQ$, false, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, $SATQ${"questionId":"239d3535","external_id":"aeb0032d-43fe-465f-891c-93f0635952bb","va